aea1cf73ed131890b38c5"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-01-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-07T05:47:48.652Z","evidenceHash":"d39d4d655b860557739c94554fecdb1cf3edd2e9985aea1cf73ed131890b38c5"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GAP.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/GAP.png","website":"https://www.gapinc.com","ceo":"Richard Dickson","full_time_employees":"79000","description":"The Gap, Inc. operates as a prominent apparel retail enterprise, offering a diverse array of clothing, accessories, and personal care products for men, women, and children. These goods are marketed under its well-known brands: Old Navy, Gap, Banana Republic, and Athleta. Its extensive product line features staples such as denim, t-shirts, fleece wear, and khakis, alongside accessories like eyewear, jewelry, footwear, handbags, and fragrances. Athleta specifically caters to women and girls with fitness and lifestyle products designed for activities including yoga, training, sports, travel, and everyday wear. The company distributes its products through various sales channels, including its own company-operated stores, franchised locations, e-commerce websites, third-party collaborations, and catalogs. Furthermore, The Gap, Inc. has established franchise partnerships with independent operators, enabling the operation of Old Navy, Gap, Athleta, and Banana Republic stores and online platforms across Asia, Europe, Latin America, the Middle East, and Africa. As of December 31, 2021, the company's retail footprint comprised 2,835 corporate-owned stores and an additional 564 franchised outlets. Incorporated in 1969, The Gap, Inc. maintains its corporate headquarters in San Francisco, California.","description_en":"The Gap, Inc. operates as a prominent apparel retail enterprise, offering a diverse array of clothing, accessories, and personal care products for men, women, and children. These goods are marketed under its well-known brands: Old Navy, Gap, Banana Republic, and Athleta. Its extensive product line features staples such as denim, t-shirts, fleece wear, and khakis, alongside accessories like eyewear, jewelry, footwear, handbags, and fragrances. Athleta specifically caters to women and girls with fitness and lifestyle products designed for activities including yoga, training, sports, travel, and everyday wear. The company distributes its products through various sales channels, including its own company-operated stores, franchised locations, e-commerce websites, third-party collaborations, and catalogs. Furthermore, The Gap, Inc. has established franchise partnerships with independent operators, enabling the operation of Old Navy, Gap, Athleta, and Banana Republic stores and online platforms across Asia, Europe, Latin America, the Middle East, and Africa. As of December 31, 2021, the company's retail footprint comprised 2,835 corporate-owned stores and an additional 564 franchised outlets. Incorporated in 1969, The Gap, Inc. maintains its corporate headquarters in San Francisco, California.","description_zh":"The Gap, Inc.（美股代碼：GAP）為 Consumer Cyclical 領域之重要企業，專注於 Apparel - Retail 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Two Folsom Street","city":"San Francisco","state":"CA","zip":"94105","country":"US","phone":"415 427 0100","full_address":"Two Folsom Street, San Francisco, CA 94105, US","range_52w":"18.11-29.36","year_high":29.36,"year_low":18.11,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":18.11,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-03","name":"FRANCIS MICHAEL","title":"officer: Brand President & CEO","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":45848,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-07","name":"FISHER WILLIAM SYDNEY","title":"director, 10 percent owner: ","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":433